    "389": {
      "date": "2026-11-23",
      "edition": "Monday 23 November",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Rankings slide",
          "heading": "Italy slip to 12th in world rankings after 16-21 Fiji defeat",
          "body": "Saturday's defeat in Udine cost Quesada's side 0.80 rating points, and the slide to 75.03 let Japan through into 11th. Japan's own loss to Scotland left their total untouched. The bigger worry sits below: Georgia beat the United States and are only 0.17 points behind on 74.86. Fiji gained the same 0.80 and now trail Wales in ninth by 0.07. It caps a group stage of six defeats in six before finals weekend at Twickenham."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
